{"id":"a25ca28a0f14be03","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-contradiction.md","title":"Proof by Contradiction","display":"df-contradiction — Proof by Contradiction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-contradiction","aliases":["58-df-contradiction","Proof by Contradiction"],"display":"df-contradiction — Proof by Contradiction","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-contradiction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-contradiction</span><span>Proof by Contradiction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-contradiction — Proof by Contradiction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,L\\in V\">\\(\\varphi,L\\in V\\)</span> (formula and language)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ContradictionStructure}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ContradictionStructure}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Contradiction}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Contradiction}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (typed predicate and compatibility projection defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}contradiction\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ContradictionStructure}_S(\\varphi,L)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\land\\neg\\exists\\mathcal M,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\land\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}contradiction\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ContradictionStructure}_S(\\varphi,L)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\land\\neg\\exists\\mathcal M,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\land\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}contradiction} \\vdash \\mathrm{Contradiction}_S(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\exists L\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ContradictionStructure}_S(\\varphi,L)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}contradiction} \\vdash \\mathrm{Contradiction}_S(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\exists L\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ContradictionStructure}_S(\\varphi,L)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A contradictory formula is unsatisfiable.  The former clause <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\vdash\\neg\\varphi\\)</span> expressed refutability in an unspecified proof calculus, not the definition of contradiction.</li>\n<li>Intuitionistic logic rejects proof by contradiction; requires constructive evidence</li>\n<li>Indirect proof: often simpler than direct; classic in analysis and algebra</li>\n<li>Minimal contradiction: derive false constant <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\perp\">\\(\\perp\\)</span> suffices; then <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi\">\\(\\phi\\)</span> from <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\perp \\implies \\phi\">\\(\\perp \\implies \\phi\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mendelson, Introduction to Mathematical Logic</li>\n<li>van Dalen, Logic and Structure</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md","status":"resolved","id":"64f35ba2e87964e0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\varphi,L\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ContradictionStructure}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Contradiction}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}contradiction\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{ContradictionStructure}_S(\\varphi,L)\\leftrightarrow\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L)\\land\\neg\\exists\\mathcal M,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\land\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}contradiction} \\vdash \\mathrm{Contradiction}_S(\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\\exists L\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ContradictionStructure}_S(\\varphi,L)","display":true},{"tex":"\\vdash\\neg\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\perp","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\perp \\implies \\phi","display":false}],"bytes":1805,"backlinks":[{"id":"6996aaff4caeacce","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ContradictionStructure}_S(\\bot,\\Sigma)$ (contradiction-formula predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-contradiction.md]])"},{"id":"27379d707b2b9345","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-364","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-contradiction.md|58-df-contradiction]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["65418b505fc53093","8b6a90316aad78a4","64f35ba2e87964e0"]}